Description: Ракета — исправление раскладки ru↔en
 After install: log out and log in once (or reboot) so the "input" group
 membership applies. Then rocket-switcher-daemon starts with the desktop session.
 .
 Qt6 GUI: rocket-switcher-config. Settings live in ~/.config/rocket-switcher/daemon.ini
 (an existing ~/.config/punto-switcher/daemon.ini is still read).
 .
 Layout switching on KDE Plasma uses qdbus6 when available.
